                                                                                                                <comments>
                            <comment id="14305811" author="dsetrakyan" created="Wed, 4 Feb 2015 19:38:18 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;We need a link to the build and a stackrace. Also steps to reproduce if applicable.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14328866" author="iveselovskiy" created="Fri, 20 Feb 2015 12:28:27 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;The problem was an introduced dependency of IgniteUtils on javax.cache.CacheException. &lt;br/&gt;
Since the javax.cache.* classes were not present in the Hadoop classpath, the IgniteUtils class failed to load.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Fixed with dependency correction: IgniteUtils does not depend on javax.cache.* any more.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
